1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:02,270
It is the eighteenth of July.

2
00:00:02,270 --> 00:00:07,890
Priya is a Compliance Officer, and she has three days left to file her fund's quarterly return.

3
00:00:07,890 --> 00:00:12,235
Four numbers have to go on it. They arrive from five different parties.

4
00:00:12,235 --> 00:00:14,755
Three of the four do not agree.

5
00:00:14,755 --> 00:00:19,250
The administrator says drawn capital is seventeen point eight million.

6
00:00:19,250 --> 00:00:22,120
Her own ledger says nineteen point three.

7
00:00:22,120 --> 00:00:25,640
Both are official. Both are signed. Neither is wrong.

8
00:00:25,640 --> 00:00:31,835
A capital call landed at five forty-two in the evening. The administrator had closed its books at four.

9
00:00:31,835 --> 00:00:36,230
So she emails the administrator, and the answer comes back in a reply.

10
00:00:36,230 --> 00:00:40,750
That reply is now the only record of why she filed what she filed.

11
00:00:40,750 --> 00:00:42,820
In October, she leaves.

12
00:00:42,820 --> 00:00:46,690
Her successor inherits the numbers, and none of the reasoning.

13
00:00:46,690 --> 00:00:51,310
The records must survive eight years. The reasoning survives fifteen days.

14
00:00:51,310 --> 00:00:54,155
Every system built for this picks one.

15
00:00:54,155 --> 00:00:58,700
Take the figure most documents agree on, and it files seventeen point eight.

16
00:00:58,700 --> 00:01:01,895
That is the wrong number, and nothing announces it.

17
00:01:01,895 --> 00:01:03,915
So we refuse to pick.

18
00:01:03,915 --> 00:01:08,710
Every number is pinned to the exact line it came from, and the moment it was true.

19
00:01:08,710 --> 00:01:12,455
This field is different. No document contains it at all.

20
00:01:12,455 --> 00:01:16,625
So it cannot be decided. Only attested, by a named person.

21
00:01:16,625 --> 00:01:19,970
Nine roles run the whole case in under eight seconds.

22
00:01:19,970 --> 00:01:25,415
Twenty of those forty steps contain no model at all, because a model cannot check a model.

23
00:01:25,415 --> 00:01:30,210
Priya decides in writing. A second person confirms. Then it seals.

24
00:01:30,210 --> 00:01:35,030
Two hundred and seventeen entities file this return four times a year.

25
00:01:35,030 --> 00:01:39,525
We have not measured hours saved, because we have never seen a real return.

26
00:01:39,525 --> 00:01:45,720
That is what we need from IFSCA. Twelve introductions, and twenty quarters of real documents.

27
00:01:45,720 --> 00:01:51,290
Then we can measure the one thing nobody has. How often these documents actually disagree.
